      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jomalaika abirio gi thoyamo abirio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo aneno ranyuth man madwoŋ ma kelo bwok i polo: Jomalaika abirio kodi thoyamo abirio. Me am'obedo thoyamo macowe, rupiri jobedo gigipiny ma nyutho keme pa Were macowe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo aneno gim'ocale pa nam ma ndewiro, m'oruwere gi mac. Aneno bende joma joloyo ogwaŋ kodi cal pere, kodi nyinge m'oketh i kwan. Jono onwaŋo jocungo dho nam ma ndewiro munyo jotiŋo tongol ma Were omiyo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 15:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onwaŋo jowero wer pa Musa, jatic pa Were kendo apa Nyathi rombo ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
